    "Amateur digicam photo of a fictional 28-year-old woman with a mature adult face, defined cheekbones and jawline, long wavy copper-red hair with a side part, fair skin with natural freckles across her nose and cheeks, light everyday makeup, soft closed-lip smile, green-hazel eyes looking at the camera. She sits on a black perforated metal mesh bench inside a glass bus shelter, knees together, hands resting in her lap. She wears an untucked white linen blouse with rolled-up sleeves, dark-blue high-waisted jeans, a small silver pendant on a thin chain and small silver hoop earrings. A black leather shoulder bag lies on the bench beside her. Behind the shelter glass: a red brick shop front with a red-and-white striped awning, a yellow painted curb along the street, parked bicycles, ordinary city daylight with soft overcast sun and faint reflections on the glass. Shot on a cheap compact digital camera from about three meters at eye level, slightly off-center framing, mild wide-angle distortion, slight sensor noise, JPEG compression, auto white balance a little cool, natural unretouched skin texture with visible pores and fine flyaway hairs, everyday candid snapshot, casual adult everyday outfit.",
